// original: Image-traced topology reference. All ten MOS symbols have D G S only.
// original: M1/M2 are NMOS; M3/M4 PMOS. All six outer bias devices are retained.
// original: Iref arrow points downward from the PMOS bias diode to the NMOS bias diode.
